Package: kulan-base
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.19.1)
Depends: ufw, unattended-upgrades, python3, python3-cryptography, libpam-runtime, libpam-u2f, pamu2fcfg, libpam-oath, oathtool
Recommends: apparmor-profiles-extra, systemd-zram-generator, systemd-oomd, kexec-tools, thermald
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ system name, updates and security defaults
 Names the system @NAME@ and adds its software update channel.
 .
 Also turns on the firewall, automatic security updates, Wi-Fi address
 randomisation and private Firefox defaults.
